   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>This should now be fixed in devel version. The change/growth models are most likely to cause errors, but the errors are hopefully getting fewer here.<br><br></div>Also, I wonder what you are doing with these lines:<br><br><div>change1 ~NA*1</div><div>change1 ~~NA*change1</div><div><br></div><div>Why put &quot;NA&quot; in there?</div><div><br></div><div>Ed</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Nov 27, 2017 at 11:10 AM, Mauricio Garnier-Villarreal <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mauga...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
