     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ed<div><br></div><div>I am running a change score model, and it is having a problem when converting the model to JAGS code. I found that the problem is that the JAGS code creates this line </div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">31  |  # Inferential covariances\r\n32  |  psi[3,,1] &lt;- lambda[2,4,1]*psi[4,4,1]*NA[NA,NA,NA]</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">And there it doesnt know what to do with the NAs.</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">I am attaching an example data set</pre></div><div><br></div><div><div>m2 &lt;- &#39;</div><div>## T2-T1</div><div>AMCORT2_sc ~ 1*PMCORT2_sc</div><div>change1 =~ 1*AMCORT2_sc</div><div><br></div><div>change1 ~NA*1</div><div>change1 ~~NA*change1</div><div><br></div><div>AMCORT2_sc ~~ 0*AMCORT2_sc</div><div>AMCORT2_sc ~0*1 </div><div><br></div><div>change1 ~~ PMCORT2_sc</div><div>&#39;</div><div><br></div><div>f2 &lt;- bcfa(m2, data=dat,inits=&quot;simple&quot;,</div><div>           adapt=4000, burnin=10000, sample=5000)</div></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Compiling rjags model...\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error : The following error occured when compiling and adapting the model using rjags:\r\n Error in rjags::jags.model(model, data = dataenv, inits = inits, n.chains = length(runjags.object$end.state),  : \r\n  RUNTIME ERROR:\r\nCompilation error on line 32.\r\nUnknown variable NA\r\nEither supply values for this variable with the data\r\nor define it  on the left hand side of a relation.</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197