    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Great, it is working. Thank your for the quick response<div><br></div><div>I set those NAs to be explicit about freely estimate the mean and variance of the change score. I know with <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463597280000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35r2Fa6PazfdXYKIrfpr0b\">std.lv</a>=F the variance will be free, but I think the latent mean is not. I have got use to be explicit in my model script even with defaults</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks again</div><div></div></div>"
    ],
