    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>When I ran it in lavaan (development version), I think I was getting the same results regardless of whether I had those NA&#39;s in there. It seems like models run under cfa() might ignore this stuff, whereas they might be necessary for models run under lavaan(). At least, that has been my experience.<br><br></div>Ed<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
