     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>When I ran it in lavaan (development version), I think I was getting the same results regardless of whether I had those NA&#39;s in there. It seems like models run under cfa() might ignore this stuff, whereas they might be necessary for models run under lavaan(). At least, that has been my experience.<br><br></div>Ed<br></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
